{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>ושמתי</b> — by the hand of Assyria." "<b>לעי</b> — like לְעִיֵּי חֲפֵרוֹת (excavations of diggers)." "<b>למטעי כרם</b> — that she not dwell." "<b>והגרתי</b> — to the ground [will I cast] the stones of her walls, that they be seen no more, for the building will be destroyed." "<b>וסודיה אגלה</b> — until the place of Samaria is no longer recognizable."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:33.072192506Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}